From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Pitoiset <samuel.pitoiset@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 16:20:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] radv: allow multisampling with 2D CUBE_COMPATIBLE images with
 MSRTSS

The spec has been updated to allow this.

This fixes
RADV_EXPERIMENTAL=msrtss ./deqp-vk -n
dEQP-VK.pipeline.*.multisample.multisampled_render_to_single_sampled.*.default_cubemap.

Fixes: 122eed44ca8 ("radv: enable VK_EXT_multisampled_render_to_single_sampled")
Signed-off-by: Samuel Pitoiset <samuel.pitoiset@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit e78ccfa6999eb16adbea9128ef3f08adda9de5e1)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45704>
(cherry picked from commit c928c34ae0d2a6d48cc23ae91416be07cb56b822)
---
 src/amd/vulkan/radv_formats.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_formats.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_formats.c
index df7cf9a7e16..e67c7ab9321 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_formats.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_formats.c
@@ -1016,7 +1016,8 @@ radv_get_image_format_properties(struct radv_physical_device *pdev, const VkPhys
    if (tiling == VK_IMAGE_TILING_OPTIMAL && info->type == VK_IMAGE_TYPE_2D &&
        (format_feature_flags &
         (VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_2_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_BIT | VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_2_DEPTH_STENCIL_ATTACHMENT_BIT)) &&
-       !(image_flags & VK_IMAGE_CREATE_2_CUBE_COMPATIBLE_BIT_KHR) &&
+       (!(image_flags & VK_IMAGE_CREATE_2_CUBE_COMPATIBLE_BIT_KHR) ||
+        (image_flags & VK_IMAGE_CREATE_2_MULTISAMPLED_RENDER_TO_SINGLE_SAMPLED_BIT_EXT)) &&
        !(image_usage & VK_IMAGE_USAGE_2_FRAGMENT_SHADING_RATE_ATTACHMENT_BIT_KHR)) {
       sampleCounts |= VK_SAMPLE_COUNT_2_BIT | VK_SAMPLE_COUNT_4_BIT | VK_SAMPLE_COUNT_8_BIT;
    }
